# What this repo takes from ANTfrastructure. One row per asset: the id from
# third_party/ANTfrastructure/shared/config/shared-assets.manifest, and a path only
# when the copy does not sit at that registry row default.
#
# Checked by:
#   bash third_party/ANTfrastructure/shared/config/sync-shared-config.sh --repo-root . --check
#
# Flat scripts/ needs explicit paths; only the resolver uses a ../.. root knob.
# None of the five shared configs is taken: no CMakeLists.txt and no C++ here.

antfrastructure-sh   scripts/lib/antfrastructure.sh
renovate-git-mode-sh   scripts/lib/renovate-git-mode.sh
#
# The Flutter web shell (shared/web/README.md), copied verbatim, and the Apache
# template under this repo's own header; --write refreshes the exact rows.
web-cookie-css
web-loading-css
web-cookies-js
web-utils-js
web-init-js
flutter-web-htaccess
